            "text": "<p>Evenflo’s travel systems put it all together for you—infant car seat plus a stroller, all in one convenient and versatile package. From baby travel systems to easy-to-expand designs, each of our models deliver a smart value that goes the distance.<br/><br/>Our stroller car seat combos make for easier, smoother car-to-stroller transitions. Simply lift up the car seat and attach it directly to the stroller, all while keeping your child comfy and safely buckled in. The little details make a big difference, too. From full-coverage canopies and oversized storage baskets to self-standing fold and adjustable handles, our travel systems meet your need for convenience and safety at every turn.</p><p>• All-in-one convenience and value <br/>• Evenflo car seat compatibility <br/>• Comfort and protection for baby <br/>• On-the-go conveniences <br/>• Extended use</p>",
